('wikiloc', '139440489', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/la-valle-de-ruda-tuc-de-saboredo-2-834-mts-and-pic-de-amitges-2-851-mts-la-vall-de-gerber-139440489', 'La Valle de Ruda - Tuc de Saboredo (2,834 mts.) and Pic de Amitges (2,851 mts.) - La Vall de Gerber', '{"en":"One-way via Ruda and Gerber valleys","ca":"Un sol sentit per valls de Ruda i Gerber","es":"Un solo sentido por valles de Ruda y Gerber"}'::jsonb, 'La Valle de Ruda - Tuc de Saboredo (2,834 mts.) and Pic de Amitges (2,851 mts.) - La Vall de Gerber Hiking trail in Baqueira-Beret, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Tuc de Saboredo (2,834 mts.) and Pic de Amitges (2,851 mts.) starting from the Valle de Ruda to the Refugi Saboredo, past Lac Major de Saboredo and Lac Glacat to the Coll de Lac Glacat. From here an out and back to ascend both Tuc de Saboredo and Pics de Amitges (Eastern and Western).
 Return down past Refugi Mataro and through La Vall de Gerber to end at the Peülla car park (Bonaigua, Pallars Sobirà).

I rated this as a difficult hike for length, elevation gain and comfort route finding on the sections with less established trails. 

NOTE: my garmin watch recorded the distance as 19 km and 1349m elevation gain - just for reference for planning as the wikiloc recording is not as accurate.', '{"en":"This challenging one-way route ascends Tuc de Saboredo (2,834m) and Pic de Amitges (2,851m) from the Valle de Ruda to the Vall de Gerber. Starting from the Valle de Ruda, the trail leads to Refugi Saboredo, passing Lac Major de Saboredo and Lac Glacat before reaching Coll de Lac Glacat.\n\nFrom the pass, an out-and-back section allows for the ascent of both summits. The return journey descends past Refugi Mataro and through the scenic Vall de Gerber, concluding at the Peülla car park near Bonaigua. This 17.2 km route with 1,163m of elevation gain requires comfort with route-finding on less established sections.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta lineal ascendeix al Tuc de Saboredo (2.834m) i al Pic de Amitges (2.851m) des de la Vall de Ruda fins a la Vall de Gerber. Començant a la Vall de Ruda, el camí porta al Refugi Saboredo, passant pel Lac Major de Saboredo i el Lac Glacat abans d''arribar al Coll de Lac Glacat.\n\nDes del coll, una secció d''anada i tornada permet l''ascens als dos cims. El retorn descendeix passant pel Refugi Mataro i a través de la pintoresca Vall de Gerber, finalitzant a l''aparcament de la Peülla, prop de Bonaigua. Aquesta ruta de 17,2 km amb 1.163m de desnivell positiu requereix habilitat per a la navegació en trams menys definits.","es":"Esta desafiante ruta lineal asciende al Tuc de Saboredo (2.834m) y al Pic de Amitges (2.851m) desde el Valle de Ruda hasta la Vall de Gerber. Comenzando en el Valle de Ruda, el sendero lleva al Refugi Saboredo, pasando por el Lac Major de Saboredo y el Lac Glacat antes de llegar al Coll de Lac Glacat.\n\nDesde el collado, una sección de ida y vuelta permite el ascenso a ambas cumbres. El regreso desciende pasando por el Refugi Mataro y a través de la pintoresca Vall de Gerber, concluyendo en el aparcamiento de la Peülla, cerca de Bonaigua. Esta rut