('wikiloc', '141118308', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/pic-de-sirvent-pic-la-colilla-tossal-bovinar-i-pic-de-coma-extrema-141118308', 'Pic de Sirvent, Pic la Colilla, Tossal Bovinar, and Pic de Coma Extrema', '{"en":"Circular via Estanys de la Pera","ca":"Circular pels Estanys de la Pera","es":"Circular por los Estanys de la Pera"}'::jsonb, 'Pic de sirvent, pic la colilla, tossal bovinar, i pic de coma extrema Hiking trail in Arànser, Catalunya (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Refugi cap del reg, refugi de pradell ,pollineres, refugi i llacs de estanys de la pera, collet de sant vicents, pic del sirvent, pic de la colilla, toosal bovinar, pic de coma extrema, port setut ,llac de setut i estany de l''orri', '{"en":"This long 21.2 km loop starts from Refugi Cap del Rec and involves a significant 1338m elevation gain. The route passes through Pollineres and the Refugi dels Estanys de la Pera before ascending.\n\nThe trail summits Pic de Sirvent, Pic de la Colilla, Tossal Bovinar, and Pic de Coma Extrema. It then descends via Port Setut, Estany de Setut, and Estany de l''Orri, offering a comprehensive tour of the area''s high peaks and lakes.\n\nThis is a demanding full-day hike suitable for experienced hikers comfortable with long distances and considerable ascent.","ca":"Aquesta llarga ruta circular de 21.2 km comença des del Refugi Cap del Rec i implica un desnivell positiu significatiu de 1338m. La ruta passa per Pollineres i el Refugi dels Estanys de la Pera abans d''iniciar l''ascens.\n\nEl camí culmina al Pic de Sirvent, Pic de la Colilla, Tossal Bovinar i Pic de Coma Extrema. Després descendeix per Port Setut, Estany de Setut i Estany de l''Orri, oferint un recorregut complet pels alts cims i llacs de la zona.\n\nAquesta és una caminada exigent de dia complet, apta per a excursionistes experimentats acostumats a llargues distàncies i ascensos considerables.","es":"Esta larga ruta circular de 21.2 km comienza desde el Refugi Cap del Rec e implica un desnivel positivo significativo de 1338m. La ruta pasa por Pollineres y el Refugi dels Estanys de la Pera antes de iniciar el ascenso.\n\nEl camino culmina en el Pic de Sirvent, Pic de la Colilla, Tossal Bovinar y Pic de Coma Extrema. Luego desciende por Port Setut, Estany de Setut y Estany de l''Orri, ofreciendo un recorrido completo por las altas cumbres y lagos de la zona.\n\nEsta es una caminata exigente de día completo, apta para excursionistas experimentados acostumbrados a largas distancias y ascensos considerables."}'::jsonb, 'Tonicrous', 21211, 1338, 1338, 2847, 1924, 'moderate', 'loop', 26100, 34320, 3917, '2023-07-19', '2023-06', '[{"lat":42.431045,"lng":1.667638,"ele":1960.2},{"lat":42.43104,"lng":1.667574,"ele":1961.8},{"lat":42.431024,"lng":1.667509,"ele":1961.8},{"lat":42.431013,"lng":1.667438,"ele":1961.8},{"lat":42.430999,"lng":1.667369,"ele":1961.8},{"lat":42.430993,"lng":1.667306,"ele":1961.5},{"lat":42.431003,"lng":1.667244,"ele":1961.1},{"lat":42.431048,"lng":1.667235,"ele":1960.9},{"lat":42.431002,"lng":1.667238,"ele":1961.3},{"lat":42.430981,"lng":1.667177,"ele":1961.8},{"lat":42.430959,"lng":1.667114,"ele":1962.1},{"lat":42.430939,"lng":1.667046,"ele":1962.1},{"lat":42.430928,"lng":1.666983,"ele":1962.1},{"lat":42.430916,"lng":1.666917,"ele":1961.9},{"lat":42.430904,"lng":1.666849,"ele":1961.1},{"lat":42.430891,"lng":1.666785,"ele":1960.7},{"lat":42.430881,"lng":1.666726,"ele":1960.1},{"lat":42.430869,"lng":1.666657,"ele":1959.8},{"lat":42.430857,"lng":1.666586,"ele":1959.6},{"lat":42.430866,"lng":1.666514,"ele":1959.4},{"lat":42.430913,"lng":1.666516,"ele":1958.9},{"lat":42.430963,"lng":1.666514,"ele":1958.7},{"lat":42.431013,"lng":1.666523,"ele":1958.7},{"lat":42.431064,"lng":1.66653,"ele":1958.7},{"lat":42.431115,"lng":1.666541,"ele":1959},{"lat":42.431159,"lng":1.666523,"ele":1959},{"lat":42.431204,"lng":1.666501,"ele":1959},{"lat":42.431254,"lng":1.666492,"ele":1959},{"lat":42.431306,"lng":1.666524,"ele":19