ca.wikiloc.com/rutes-alpinisme/pic-de-thoumasset-i-pic-de-lestany-blau-per-rialb-aspres-de-banyell-i-estanys-de-solanet-i-blau-des-248738124', '{"en":"This moderate loop begins at Coll de la Botella, accessible via the CG-4 road from La Massana. Parking is available near a ski station cabin. The route initially flanks Serra dels Corrals, passing through Costes de l’Ait to Coll del Torer.\n\nFrom Coll del Torer, a steep ascent along the east ridge leads to Alt de la Capa (2572m). The trail then follows an easy and panoramic ridge walk around Coma de Setúria, summiting Pic de Port Negre (2571m), Roc Rodó (2512m), and Cap de l’Ovella (2541m). The descent from Port de Cabús is on grassy slopes to Bordes de Setúria, followed by a short climb back to Coll de la Botella.","ca":"Aquesta ruta circular moderada comença al Coll de la Botella, accessible per la carretera CG-4 des de la Massana. Hi ha aparcament prop d''una cabana de l''estació d''esquí. La ruta flanqueja inicialment la Serra dels Corrals, passant per les Costes de l’Ait fins al Coll del Torer.\n\nDes del Coll del Torer, una pujada costeruda per la carena est porta a l''Alt de la Capa (2572m). El camí segueix una carena fàcil i panoràmica al voltant de la Coma de Setúria, assolint el Pic de Port Negre (2571m), el Roc Rodó (2512m) i el Cap de l’Ovella (2541m). El descens des del Port de Cabús és per vessants herbats fins a les Bordes de Setúria, seguit d''una curta pujada de retorn al Coll de la Botella.","es":"Esta ruta circular moderada comienza en el Coll de la Botella, accesible por la carretera CG-4 desde La Massana. Hay aparcamiento cerca de una cabaña de la estación de esquí. La ruta flanquea inicialmente la Serra dels Corrals, pasando por las Costes de l’Ait hasta el Coll del Torer.\n\nDesde el Coll del Torer, un ascenso empinado por la cresta este lleva al Alt de la Capa (2572m). El camino sigue una cresta fácil y panorámica alrededor de la Coma de Setúria, coronando el Pic de Port Negre (2571m), el Roc Rodó (2512m) y el Cap de l’Ovella (2541m). El descenso desde el Port de Cabús es por laderas herbadas hasta las Bordes de Setúria, seguido de una corta subida de regreso al Coll de la Botella."}'::jsonb, 'Aventura''t', 11523, 991, 991, 2566, 1860, 'moderate', 'loop', NULL, 26760, 1391, '2016-08-30', '2016-07', '[{"lat":42.54575,"lng":1.452785,"ele":2073},{"lat":42.545807,"lng":1.452792,"ele":2073},{"lat":42.545826,"lng":1.452802,"ele":2073},{"lat":42.545879,"lng":1.452829,"ele":2073.3},{"lat":42.5459,"lng":1.452822,"ele":2073.4},{"lat":42.545933,"lng":1.452807,"ele":2073.7},{"lat":42.546048,"lng":1.452753,"ele":2074.1},{"lat":42.546095,"lng":1.452729,"ele":2074},{"lat":42.546113,"lng":1.452718,"ele":2073.9},{"lat":42.546277,"lng":1.452665,"ele":2074.5},{"lat":42.546331,"lng":1.452654,"ele":2074.8},{"lat":42.546554,"lng":1.452598,"ele":2074.9},{"lat":42.546664,"lng":1.452553,"ele":2074.7},{"lat":42.546857,"lng":1.452517,"ele":2076.2},{"lat":42.546946,"lng":1.452508,"ele":2077.1},{"lat":42.547086,"lng":1.45253,"ele":2077.3},{"lat":42.54711,"lng":1.452539,"ele":2077.4},{"lat":42.547325,"lng":1.452559,"ele":2078},{"lat":42.547484,"lng":1.452582,"ele":2078.7},{"lat":42.547706,"lng":1.452603,"ele":2080.8},{"lat":42.547857,"lng":1.452603,"ele":2081.7},{"lat":42.547984,"lng":1.452604,"ele":2082.4},{"lat":42.548206,"lng":1.45263,"ele":2083.4},{"lat":42.548305,"lng":1.452681,"ele":2084.9},{"lat":42.54852,"lng":1.452744,"ele":2085.6},{"lat":42.548721,"lng":1.452824,"ele":2087},{"lat":42.548897,"lng":1.452925,"ele":2088.6},{"lat":42.54907,"lng":1.453046,"ele":2090.4},{"lat":42.549241,"lng":1.453148,"ele":2092.4},{"lat":42.549424,"lng":1.453258,"ele":2094},{"lat":42.5496,"lng":1.45332,"ele":2095.6},{"lat":42.549826,"lng":1.453362,"ele":2097.7},{"lat":42.55002,"lng":1.453414,"ele":2100.4},{"lat":42.550211,"lng":1.453472,"ele":2100.6},{"lat":42.55031,"lng":1.453524,"ele":2101},{"lat":42.550472,"lng":1.453625,"ele":2101.7},{"lat":42.550561,"lng":1.453693,"ele":2102.6},{"lat":42.550